<title>USA: Sioux City cattle close mostly $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle close mostly $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to last week slaughter steers and heifers were mostly $1.00 lower in moderate trade, USDA said. Supply: 200 plus 100 cows and bulls.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-3, 1100-1325 lbs 66.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3, 1050-1300 lbs 65.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Holsteins: Select and Choice 2-3, 1275-1325 lbs 61.00-62.25.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Load  Choice 2-3, drug free,  1180  lbs 67.50. Choice 2-3, 1100-1250 lbs 66.00-67.00.  Select and Choice 2-3, 1075-1200 lbs 65.00-66.00.  Few Select 63.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
